# Release Notes Directory

This directory contains phase-specific release notes for Farm to Stars.

**Files:**
- `homestead.md` — Homestead phase release notes (Weeks 1-10)
- `township.md` — Township phase release notes (Weeks 13-24)
- `nation.md` — Nation phase release notes (Weeks 25-40)
- `stellar.md` — Stellar phase release notes (Weeks 41-56)

**Format:** See `Docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md` §6 for template.
